Package: CommuteCA
Title: CommuteCA: Datasets and Methods for Job Accessibility in Canada
Version: 5.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Bruno", "Dos Santos", , "dossanb@mcmaster.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6748-2038")),
           person("Antonio", "Paez", , "paezha@mcmaster.ca", role = c("aut"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6912-9919")))
Description: 
  Provides datasets and standardized methods for job accessibility analysis using the 
  2021 Census of Population of Statistics Canada. Includes synthetic test data, 
  aggregated land-use datasets, and calibrated impedance functions for commuting 
  by transportation mode. Created with support from the Research Data Centre at 
  McMaster University, the Sherman Centre for Digital Scholarship, and Mobilizing Justice.
